SOAPBOX: K3CCR is the club station at the Collington continuing-care
SOAPBOX: retirement community at FM 18OW in MD, just east of DC. N3UM and
SOAPBOX: W5MPB did Multi-2 in 2026 CQ WPX RTTY. We hoped to beat our 2025
SOAPBOX: result of 3889 QSO points and 721 WPX mults for a 2.80 M claim.
SOAPBOX: Nope we got 0.98 X the QSO points & 0.91 X the mults for 0.90 X
SOAPBOX: our 2025 claim. Low SFI & high Kp this year cost us 62 mults vs
SOAPBOX: 2025. But, hourly cum-Q values were 2025 till near the end. This
SOAPBOX: margin was 100 for 9 hrs 18Z Sat.-02Z Sun. incl, with Kp of 4+
SOAPBOX: & then 5+. Then in the last few hrs Sun, a major nearby power-grid
SOAPBOX: fault gave us many 1-2 sec dropouts and a few of 10+ sec, so ham
SOAPBOX: gear and software had to be reset & re-booted. No way to catch up.
